    "detailsSection": "The integration runtime is capable of moving data in and out of data stores within private network, dispatching activities against compute service within private network. You can install a self-hosted integration runtime on an on-premises machine or a virtual machine inside a private network.<br/>\n<b>Note:</b> An Integration Runtime instance can be registered with an instance of <a href=\"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=858211\">Azure Data Factory</a>, or an instance of Azure Synapse Analytics. For Microsoft Purview, please download <a href=\"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2246619\">Microsoft Purview Integration Runtime</a>.",
